SUMMARY:Candle Magick: The Alchemical Flame with Fairlight
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nCandle Magick: The Alchemical Flame\nMay 
 13th \\| 5:00 PM – 7:00 PM \\| $45\n\nStep into the world of fire alchem
 y in this hands-on workshop. We will explore the ancient art of candle mag
 ick through three distinct ritual practices:\n• Hand-Rolling: Craft your
  own candles using natural beeswax sheets.\n• Sigil & Herb Craft: Anoint
  and dress votive candles using botanical ingredients\, essential oils\, a
 nd specialized potions like truth serum and snake oil.\n• Cord Cutting: 
 Use colored tapers to perform a ritual of release and energetic boundary-s
 etting.\n\nAll supplies provided. Space is strictly limited to 13 particip
 ants to ensure a personalized experience.
